您的反馈最好包括一些屏幕截图@comma{} GIFs@comma{} 或短片@comma{} 以及取消给出设置的进一步说明。虽然这不是一个要求。

无论您做什么@comma{}，请记住 Modus 主题的总体目标：保持背景颜色和前景色之间的修复大于或等于 7:1。如果在美观和可访问性之间做出妥协@comma{}，则应始终为了首先的利益而做出需要的妥协。

@node Patches require copyright assignment to the FSF
@section 需要将版权转让给FSF的土地

非常欢迎代码贡献。对于任何重大编辑（每人总计超过 15 行@comma{}或左右@comma{}）@comma{}，您需要向自由软件基金会进行版权转让。必要的，因为主题是上游 Emacs 发行版的一部分：FSF 必须始终能够执行 GNU 通用公共许可证。

版权转让是一个简单的过程。检查下面的申请表（请相应调整）。您必须向表格中提到的地址写一份电子邮件，然后等待 FSF 向您发送法律协议。签署文件并归档回给他们。这一切都可以通过电子邮件完成，大约需要一周的时间。我们鼓励您完成这个过程。您只需做一次。总的来说，这就允许您为 Emacs 做出贡献。

@example
Please email the following information to assign@@gnu.org@comma{} and we
will send you the assignment form for your past and future changes.

Please use your full legal name (in ASCII characters) as the subject
line of the message.

REQUEST: SEND FORM FOR PAST AND FUTURE CHANGES

[What is the name of the program or package you're contributing to?]

GNU Emacs

[Did you copy any files or text written by someone else in these changes?
Even if that material is free software@comma{} we need to know about it.]

Copied a few snippets from the same files I edited.  Their author@comma{}
Protesilaos Stavrou@comma{} has already assigned copyright to the Free Software
Foundation.

[Do you have an employer who might have a basis to claim to own
your changes?  Do you attend a school which might make such a claim?]


[For the copyright registration@comma{} what country are you a citizen of?]


[What year were you born?]


[Please write your email address here.]


[Please write your postal address here.]





[Which files have you changed so far@comma{} and which new files have you written
so far?]

@end example

